# Sysbuild settings for P02 that depend on the board. Settings for every board are in sysbuild.conf.
#
# A Kconfig.sysbuild in the app directory replaces sysbuild's Kconfig root, so the file ends by sourcing
# it. The defaults below come first on purpose: Kconfig uses the first default of a choice whose condition
# is true, and Zephyr's own defaults (swap using offset; overwrite only on Espressif chips) are in the
# sourced files.

# The MCUboot mode: one that can roll an update back. Swap using move works with equal slots, as on these
# boards. The Daisy Seed is not listed: its board keeps RAM load (zephyr/boards/electrosmith/daisy_seed/
# Kconfig.sysbuild).
choice MCUBOOT_MODE
	default MCUBOOT_MODE_SWAP_USING_MOVE if BOARD_NUCLEO_G0B1RE
	default MCUBOOT_MODE_SWAP_USING_MOVE if BOARD_ARDUINO_NANO_ESP32
endchoice

source "share/sysbuild/Kconfig"
